    "detailed_description": "It's a nice sunny day in Dingletopia and Prince Dingle Dorfen and his wise adviser Forlorn Gumpel are slurping up the gorpulsen and planning their next conquest. Their life of luxury is soon interrupted however when Orcs burst into the lands with rattling sabers.<br><br>How will YOU rule Dingletopia?<br><br><strong>GENRE</strong><br>Epic High Fantasy War Strategy-palooza Bonanza<br><br><strong>GAME INFO</strong><br>Use your wits and influence to expand your empire. Build your armies to attack and defend against the Orcs. Make impossible choices that will echo throughout history. <br><br><strong>PROS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1595046621\" /></div> \u00a022 unique units.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1595046621\" /></div> \u00a0Non-linear nation building and strategy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1595046621\" /></div> \u00a0Teaches about Dwarf lore.<br><br><strong>CONS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras/b44c04650166727dfcaa914e671f5cc7.webp?t=1595046621\" /></div> \u00a0Is in a Fantasy setting.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras/b44c04650166727dfcaa914e671f5cc7.webp?t=1595046621\" /></div> \u00a0Is less enjoyable than winning the lottery.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286140/extras